00:22:13,390 --> 00:22:19,150
which will be posted to a REST API where the payload will be processed,

323
00:22:19,150 --> 00:22:24,151
a response will come back, and it's very much that typical sort of RESTful flow. that we're all used to.

324
00:22:24,151 --> 00:22:33,550
And so, what we are able to do is capture this payload as it comes through CodeGate on.

325
00:22:33,550 --> 00:22:35,910
its way to the LLM inference point.

