00:43:17,110 --> 00:43:22,590
And these are technologies that are very much under hype at the moment starting to really get traction,

631
00:43:22,590 --> 00:43:24,910
especially model context protocol.

632
00:43:24,910 --> 00:43:29,390
It's one that's lots of MCP servers coming online to allow you to interface.

633
00:43:29,390 --> 00:43:32,110
and control applications and machines.

634
00:43:32,110 --> 00:43:37,911
These are, you know, they're JavaScript based and not saying that JavaScript's a bad language, but it's a language.

