00:43:54,070 --> 00:43:59,990
You know, it's probably one of the ones that's that's seen more risks manifest than most languages.

640
00:43:59,990 --> 00:44:02,630
I guess because it's web facing.

641
00:44:02,630 --> 00:44:07,310
And so, there's a lot to be concerned around with with this ability for large language models to.

642
00:44:07,320 --> 00:44:12,710
control machines and access APIs and move data around and.

643
00:44:12,710 --> 00:44:15,150
and then of course you have agents.

