00:44:15,150 --> 00:44:18,630
So agents being these autonomous goal-driven entities.

645
00:44:18,630 --> 00:44:20,270
that are connected to a large language model.

646
00:44:20,270 --> 00:44:25,310
and they are able to go off and with the goal of solving a task.

